Local changes: selected the public root literal and two version 0.3 certificate-signed
verification bundles, converted literal data to JSON, omitted undefined object properties,
and copied the exact public artifact bytes. The pinned protobuf bundle roundtrip removed
two unsigned default log fields from the message bundle: integratedTime with value "0"
and inclusionPromise with value null. The root and bundle files use canonical minified
JSON with one terminal LF and the byte-oriented .sigstore extension. Signed fields were
not changed.

This is test data only. No production trust root or publisher approval is established.
